language Jinja/Twig/Django (HTML, CSS, JavaScript)
masks *.j2 *.jinja *.twig
start html
inject jinja
ident _$
symbol 1 /(?i)^\s*<h1\b[^>]*>\s*([^<]+)/
symbol 2 /(?i)^\s*<h2\b[^>]*>\s*([^<]+)/
symbol 3 /(?i)^\s*<h3\b[^>]*>\s*([^<]+)/
symbol 4 /(?i)^\s*<h4\b[^>]*>\s*([^<]+)/
symbol 5 /(?i)^\s*<h5\b[^>]*>\s*([^<]+)/
symbol 6 /(?i)^\s*<h6\b[^>]*>\s*([^<]+)/
symbol 2 /^\s*\{%-?\s*(?:block|macro)\s+(\w+)/
%include part-html
%include part-js
%include part-css
%include part-jinja
